<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 4: Three-Generation Family Pedigree</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">
        Capture cancer history for grandparents, parents, aunts/uncles, siblings, children, and cousins.
        The detailed per-relative pedigree builder is captured separately; this section records summary
        counts used by the grader.
    </p>

    <h3>Mother</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="mother_name">Name (or initials)</label>
            <input type="text" id="mother_name" name="family_pedigree.mother.name"
                   value="{{ family_pedigree.mother.name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="mother_affected">Affected with cancer?</label>
            <select id="mother_affected" name="family_pedigree.mother.affected_with_cancer">
                <option value="" {% if family_pedigree.mother.affectedWithCancer == "" %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
                <option value="no" {% if family_pedigree.mother.affectedWithCancer == "no" %}selected{% endif %}>No</option>
                <option value="yes" {% if family_pedigree.mother.affectedWithCancer == "yes" %}selected{% endif %}>Yes</option>
                <option value="unknown" {% if family_pedigree.mother.affectedWithCancer == "unknown" %}selected{% endif %}>Unknown</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Father</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="father_name">Name (or initials)</label>
            <input type="text" id="father_name" name="family_pedigree.father.name"
                   value="{{ family_pedigree.father.name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="father_affected">Affected with cancer?</label>
            <select id="father_affected" name="family_pedigree.father.affected_with_cancer">
                <option value="" {% if family_pedigree.father.affectedWithCancer == "" %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
                <option value="no" {% if family_pedigree.father.affectedWithCancer == "no" %}selected{% endif %}>No</option>
                <option value="yes" {% if family_pedigree.father.affectedWithCancer == "yes" %}selected{% endif %}>Yes</option>
                <option value="unknown" {% if family_pedigree.father.affectedWithCancer == "unknown" %}selected{% endif %}>Unknown</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="form-hint">
        Detailed sibling, cousin, and grandparent records are persisted via the JSON payload from the
        front-end form-with-svelte builder; only summary attestations are captured here.
    </p>
</div>
